normally large.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 218, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "a7c5fce7-6718-4248-829b-5671694ea8d6": {"__data__": {"id_": "a7c5fce7-6718-4248-829b-5671694ea8d6", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-008", "category": "File Upload"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "3bf27f66-c449-469a-ac89-8efc489b5a72", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-008", "category": "File Upload"}, "hash": "3c7537cbe32d233ed82bdb58093a72859399a1c13edfb0dfca5aead4e9bb67c6", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Title: File uploads failing for large files\nDescription: Users unable to upload files larger than 5MB. Progress bar reaches 100% but then shows 'Upload failed' error. Works fine for smaller files. Browser console shows 413 error.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 229, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "a23bae88-1d7b-4b1b-ac71-e1ec9891280d": {"__data__": {"id_": "a23bae88-1d7b-4b1b-ac71-e1ec9891280d", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-009", "category": "API"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "0d180509-7537-4112-9084-8a5675717967", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-009", "category": "API"}, "hash": "3f3e430712f98cbecf5a2cd00c6a05e03c98f6585af99c061de609406a4ebf5a", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Title: API rate limiting too aggressive\nDescription: Legitimate users hitting rate limits during normal usage. Current limit is 100 requests per minute. Users getting 429 Too Many Requests errors, especially when using batch operations.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 236, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "5730a31b-ab18-487b-a54a-77de03ef455f": {"__data__": {"id_": "5730a31b-ab18-487b-a54a-77de03ef455f", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-010", "category": "Performance"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "8876cfff-c409-4ed5-9441-bfe9de74d8f3", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-010", "category": "Performance"}, "hash": "990dcb35d531e26f8b995a94f00d88c572aa460b9acca25444f18655c3538c63", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Title: Dashboard loading extremely slowly\nDescription: Admin dashboard takes 30+ seconds to load. Browser DevTools show multiple slow database queries. Page becomes unresponsive during load. Affects all users with admin privileges.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 231, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "bf73ddf3-6e29-4952-a683-bc9c14af4eb8": {"__data__": {"id_": "bf73ddf3-6e29-4952-a683-bc9c14af4eb8", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-011", "category": "Authentication"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "37adb80d-5986-4f10-b090-abce8a47fbaa", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-011", "category": "Authentication"}, "hash": "497b642a8dc5d1b72c763733e2ff971f322e8ceb36387f098b9a6fedc2e5709a", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Title: SSO authentication broken after upgrade\nDescription: Single Sign-On integration with corporate SAML provider failing. Users redirected to SSO portal but then receive 'Invalid SAML response' error when redirected back. Started after v2.5 upgrade.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 252, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "2e0c32fd-7a4b-45c4-af29-7d0822aec91e": {"__data__": {"id_": "2e0c32fd-7a4b-45c4-af29-7d0822aec91e", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-012", "category": "Reporting"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "f8d17aba-7331-4a00-b9d4-bc8237598202", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-012", "category": "Reporting"}, "hash": "7db13d713bdaf7d093f119f54b2535b571fe1df2652c8f0c036eafe22815d546", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Title: Scheduled reports not generating\nDescription: Daily scheduled reports stopped generating three days ago. Cron job shows as running in logs but no PDF files are created. Manual report generation works correctly.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 217, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "eb5e337f-186d-43dc-b9d5-31ad1c987f56": {"__data__": {"id_": "eb5e337f-186d-43dc-b9d5-31ad1c987f56", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-013", "category": "Integration"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "87b628a0-bc23-495f-a4b3-477b0837c582", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-013", "category": "Integration"}, "hash": "80cac6d815368e0effe86e361f7c41de630748f455087d2fc574b86e24b509a5", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Title: Webhook deliveries failing intermittently\nDescription: Outgoing webhooks to customer endpoints timing out. Retry logic exhausting all attempts. Some webhooks succeed while others fail for same endpoint. No pattern to failures.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 233, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "051fe66c-5966-4496-b11f-b765f8e0339d": {"__data__": {"id_": "051fe66c-5966-4496-b11f-b765f8e0339d", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-014", "category": "Authentication"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "805d246f-d2e4-453b-9ba9-e1f25a3c10ea", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-014", "category": "Authentication"}, "hash": "b70365a3c32485e00448b26bf7d14721f79578f0c22888dd7016e5372c96e039", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Title: Session timeout too short\nDescription: Users complaining about being logged out too frequently. Currently set to 15 minutes. Particularly problematic for users filling out long forms, losing unsaved data when session expires.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 232, "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "05ff75a0-995c-41b1-a413-5c61120dcac3": {"__data__": {"id_": "05ff75a0-995c-41b1-a413-5c61120dcac3", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-015", "category": "Export"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b79f95b3-d75c-4ad1-b279-7b18a3649896", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"ticket_id": "TICK-015", "category": "Export"}, "hash": "e3c244cb199a4e0f80129327078bbdc447d9c1358ad788eb42b6da23f0ff7e2d", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Title: Export to CSV producing corrupt files\nDescription: Data export feature generating CSV files that can't be opened in Excel. File appears to have encoding issues with special characters. Particularly affects records with non-ASCII c